    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pzdn](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pzdn) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Mar 17 2025 45km NW of Bula. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -2.8718 longitude 130.1613. It impacted 58938 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
